+<!-- SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Jandira Technologies, LLC -->
+<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only -->
+# Adoption experiments
+
+The ledger contains only consenting, pseudonymous project observations. Do not
+commit contact details, document contents or customer filenames. No telemetry
+is emitted by the library or recipes.
+
+Run the Python recipe after installing `python-docx` and `jubarte-redlines`:
+
+```sh
+python examples/adoption/python_docx_pdf.py /tmp/jubarte-example.pdf
+```
+
+Run the Node recipe with `docx` and `jubarte-wasm` available to Node resolution:
+
+```sh
+node examples/adoption/docx_js_pdf.mjs /tmp/jubarte-node-example.pdf
+```
+
+Outputs use exclusive creation; choose a fresh output path for each run. A PDF
+signature proves the renderer produced a PDF-shaped result; inspect the PDF and
+run the corpus gates before making any layout or Word-fidelity claim.
+
+Record trial completion, assistance and repeat use at day 14 and day 28.
+A successful local maintainer smoke is not an independent acquired user.
